{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"二十有九年春，新延廐。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"夏，鄭人侵許。秋，有蜚。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"冬十有二月，紀叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"城諸及防。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"二十九年春，新作延廐。書，不時也。凡馬，日中而出，日中而入。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"夏，鄭人侵許。凡師，有鐘鼓曰伐，無曰侵，輕曰襲。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"秋，有蜚，為災也。凡物，不為災，不書。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"冬十二月，城諸及防，書，時也。凡土功，龍見而畢務，戒事也；火見而致用，水昏正而栽，日至而畢。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_58_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_58","textTraditional":"樊皮叛王。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}